# Content Manager

Do not call Kurtosys Content Manager from a widget bundle, and do not put `KSYS_CONTENT_TOKEN` in `env.config.cjs`.

- WordPress proxy: `hosts/cms/wordpress/ksys-content.php`, route `/wp-json/ksys/v1/content/{type}/{name}`.
- Widgets read `data-content-base-url` and use `loadContentHtml` / `useContentHtml`.
- `useContentHtml` stays off until the widget passes `enabled`.
- Missing content returns `undefined`. Do not invent fallback copy.

See `docs/CONTENT-MANAGER.md`.
